  "question": {
    "text": "The coercivity of a magnet is $5 \\times 10^3 \\mathrm{~A} / \\mathrm{m}$. The amount of current required to be passed in a solenoid of length $30 \\mathrm{~cm}$ and the number of turns 150 , so that the magnet gets demagnetised when inside the solenoid is _____A.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2Ca9ebgPH7LOb-A4W4wP6EN_LTd7KUz1YSm2SuvLn-E.original.fullsize.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{H}_{\\mathrm{c}}=\\frac{\\mu_{\\mathrm{o}} \\mathrm{ni}}{\\mu_{\\mathrm{o}}} \\\\ & 5 \\times 10^3=\\frac{150}{30} \\times 100 \\times \\mathrm{i} \\\\ & \\frac{50}{5}=\\mathrm{i} \\\\ & \\mathrm{I}=10\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
